  "bodyHash": "cNN7yTQml2k=",
  "content": "<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c72yiPmFS_4?si=8Ah5plY5ecdyT6ND\" width=\"855\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><em>Immersive Lanterns</em> 新增了將燈籠穿戴在身上並與 Accessories 模組相容的功能，支援動態光源與自訂擺動物理效果！</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172669/description_07ffa204-5555-4f4e-af62-0a714cbd392b.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ImmersiveLanterns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172669/description_8a85bc5f-6502-4f6a-bff8-a2bb83b4efcc.png\"></p><p>厭倦了在副手位攜帶盾牌或火把之間做選擇嗎？很簡單，只要製作一個燈籠，然後蹲下並按右鍵即可將其裝備到您的飾品欄位！燈籠會垂掛在您的腰帶上，照亮周圍區域。當您在遊戲中移動時，燈籠在第三人稱視角下會像鐘擺一樣搖晃。</p><p>有幾個模組也以類似方式為燈籠添加動態光源支援，但 <strong>Immersive Lanterns</strong> 是第一個完全相容於自訂動態光源的 <strong>Iris 光影包</strong> 的模組。例如，如果您裝備靈魂燈籠並使用 Complementary 光影，您將會獲得藍色光源！</p><p>Immersive Lanterns 適用於 Forge 和 Fabric 的 1.20.1 和 1.21.1+ 版本。在所有平台上，它都依賴於 Accessories 和 Sodium/Embeddium Dynamic Lights。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
